      "content_sha256": "9febe0d3837eb07ab535227d58e54fa7fa71b844932b49e52bb2208be5016ac4"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Assuming different families are unrelated, the total likelihood is the product of the individual likelihoods from the $ n_{f} $ families,",
