    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ \\ell(z_i) $ is given by Equation 13.11b. Although there are numerous summation and product indices in this likelihood, there are only five unknown parameters: the three genotypic means, the common variance $ \\sigma^2 $, and the QTL allele frequency p.",
